// veew[4:3], vlmul[2:0]. exceptionVec bit k is exception 1..13, 15, 19..23 (bit 0 = _1, bit 18 = _23); a port
// that carries fewer exceptions leaves the other bits 0.

// ROB pointer order: a is after b (younger) when it wrapped differently or sits further on.
